		{"id":"aedd4650ed5766d7","type":"text","text":"[[Insula Nefanda.canvas]]\n#WildFort","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7dfce083fe4e4a7a","x":-100,"y":100,"width":685,"height":320,"type":"text","text":"Iron doors lead to a walkway that leads on 50feet before opening into a large circular chamber, in the center a raised stone platform with an Alter in the middle. \n\n\nSurrounding the center is another circular loft with destroyed stone chairs\n\n\nLighting: The room is bathed in a sickly, dim green glow emanating from the central ritual and large glass vats lining the walls, casting long, unnatural shadows.\n\nDecor: The walls are lined with surgical tools forged from bone, towering bookshelves of decayed flesh-bound tomes, and rusted iron cages hanging from chains in the ceiling.\n\nThe Floor: Polished obsidian tile that reflects the dark magic happening in the center, making the floor look like a bottomless void."}
	],
	"edges":[]
}